WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.262
Select neighbouring parcels. Use Detect block for the

2
00:00:03.309 --> 00:00:06.223
whole site, then choose Row houses.

3
00:00:06.573 --> 00:00:10.300
Set length, width and height. Reshape the footprint

4
00:00:10.462 --> 00:00:12.517
so it fits the selected land.

5
00:00:12.873 --> 00:00:15.938
Finish the rule to save the row-house design.

6
00:00:16.288 --> 00:00:19.481
Review the warning about different parcel shapes, then

7
00:00:19.562 --> 00:00:21.861
confirm whether to proceed.

8
00:00:22.221 --> 00:00:25.507
Inspect the row in 3D. Tilt and rotate

9
00:00:25.553 --> 00:00:28.676
to see its relationship to the neighbouring buildings.
